            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: say the Kannada for hospital, then the Kannada for a tablet."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ನಿಧಾನವಾಗಿ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ನಿಧಾನವಾಗಿ (nidhānavāgi) — \"slowly\". The ending ‑ಆಗಿ (-āgi) turns a word into a manner, \"in a slow way\", like ಚೆನ್ನಾಗಿ (cennāgi), \"well\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ನಿಧಾನವಾಗಿ ಮಾತಾಡಿ (nidhānavāgi mātāḍi) — \"please speak slowly\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The most useful request a learner can make."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "guided-production",
          "title": "Guided Practice",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 1,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 1s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "nidhānavāgi",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *nidhānavāgi*]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "nidhānavāgi, once more",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *nidhānavāgi*, once more]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "say nidhānavāgi mātāḍi",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: say *nidhānavāgi mātāḍi*]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "RECALL",
              "instruction": "say the Kannada for hospital, then the Kannada for a tablet, then say nidhānavāgi again",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU RECALL: say the Kannada for hospital, then the Kannada for a tablet, then say *nidhānavāgi* again]"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "type": "recall",
          "title": "Wrap-up Recall",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 3,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 3s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "What does ನಿಧಾನವಾಗಿ (nidhānavāgi) mean? (\"Slowly\".) Say it once more."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
